# Adding electrons to Cu atoms

units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p

neighbor 6 bin

atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.62

region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box

create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 63.546
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ./Cu_EAMX.eamalloy Cu

variable eatom equal pe/atoms

run 0
print "E/N = ${eatom}"

write_data cu_with_electrons.dat